            "text": "{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What is the weather in Tokyo? Use get_weather, then answer in one short sentence. Then solve, reasoning it through first: a train leaves at 09:47 and travels 283 km at 74 km/h; when does it arrive, to the minute?\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01MSwDa8ibREp4JEBiV2LHRf\",\"name\":\"get_weather\",\"input\":{\"city\":\"Tokyo\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01MSwDa8ibREp4JEBiV2LHRf\",\"content\":\"Tokyo: clear\\n25°C, wind 10 km/h\",\"is_error\":false}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"I'm dividing 283 by 74 to get about 3.82 hours, which is 3 hours plus 61 km over 74 km/h. That remainder works out to roughly 49.5 minutes. Adding 3 hours 49 minutes to 09:47 gives 13:36.\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tokyo is clear right now, at 25°C with a 10 km/h wind.\\n\\n**Train arrival:**\\n- Travel time is 283 ÷ 74 ≈ 3.824 hours.\\n- 3 hours covers 222 km, which leaves 61 km.\\n- The last 61 km take 61 ÷ 74 × 60 ≈ 49.5 minutes.\\n- So the trip takes about 3 hours 49.5 minutes.\\n- 09:47 + 3 h 49.5 min ≈ 13:36:28.\\n\\n**The train arrives at about 13:36.**\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Should I bring an umbrella? One word.\",\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}],\"max_tokens\":128000,\"stream\":true,\"system\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You are a weather assistant. Answer briefly.\\n\\n<addendum>\\nReference for pi-restore-anthropic-opus-5-5-thinking: the weather desk's station catalog. Use it only when aske